<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Privacy Policy - Sheet to Trello' }) %>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50">
    <div class="flex flex-col min-h-screen">
        <% if (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user) { %>
            <%- include('partials/header', { currentPage: null, user: user }) %>
        <% } else { %>
            <nav class="bg-white border-b border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
                <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center h-16">
                        <a href="/" class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                            <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 via-indigo-600 to-purple-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
                                <i class="fab fa-trello text-white text-xl"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex flex-col">
                                <h1 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight">Sheet to Trello</h1>
                                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Automation Platform</p>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                        <a href="/login" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:text-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-50 transition-all duration-200">
                            <i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt mr-2"></i>Login
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </nav>
        <% } %>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <main class="flex-1 w-full pb-20 relative">
            <!-- Fade gradient overlay at bottom -->
            <div class="fixed bottom-16 left-0 right-0 h-20 bg-gradient-to-t from-gray-50 to-transparent pointer-events-none z-0"></div>
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-8 md:p-12">
                <div class="mb-8">
                    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %></p>
                </div>

                <div class="prose prose-blue max-w-none">
                    <section class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fas fa-info-circle text-blue-600 mr-3"></i>
                            Introduction
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            Welcome to Sheet to Trello ("we," "our," or "us"). We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring transparency about how we collect, use, and safeguard your information. This Privacy Policy explains our practices regarding data collection and usage when you use our automation platform.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                            By using our service, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy. We only collect and use data that is necessary to provide our automation services between Google Sheets and Trello.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fas fa-database text-blue-600 mr-3"></i>
                            Information We Collect
                        </h2>
                        
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3 mt-6">1. Authentication Information</h3>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
                            <li><strong>Email Address:</strong> Used to identify and authenticate your account</li>
                            <li><strong>Profile Information:</strong> Your name and profile picture from your Google account for personalized dashboard experience</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3 mt-6">2. Google Sheets Data (Read-Only)</h3>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
                            <li>We temporarily read data from your Google Sheets to extract milestone information (Title, Description, Due Date, Labels, Members, etc.)</li>
                            <li>This data is used solely to create corresponding Trello cards</li>
                            <li>We do <strong>not</strong> permanently store the content of your Google Sheets</li>
                            <li>We only store the Google Sheet ID reference in your workflow configuration so you can re-run workflows on the same sheet</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3 mt-6">3. Trello API Credentials</h3>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
                            <li>Your Trello API Key and Token are stored securely in our database</li>
                            <li>All Trello credentials are encrypted using AES-256 encryption before storage</li>
                            <li>These credentials are used only to create Trello cards on your behalf</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3 mt-6">4. Workflow Configuration Data</h3>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
                            <li>Workflow settings (selected Trello board, list, sheet references)</li>
                            <li>Workflow execution logs and status</li>
                            <li>Card creation history and results</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3 mt-6">5. Access Tokens</h3>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
                            <li>Google OAuth access tokens and refresh tokens for API access</li>
                            <li>Tokens are stored securely and automatically refreshed when needed</li>
                            <li>Tokens are used only to access your Google Sheets and Drive (read-only)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

                    <section class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fas fa-cog text-blue-600 mr-3"></i>
                            How We Use Your Information
                        </h2>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
                            <li><strong>Service Provision:</strong> To provide automation services between Google Sheets and Trello</li>
                            <li><strong>Authentication:</strong> To identify and authenticate your account</li>
                            <li><strong>Data Processing:</strong> To read milestone data from your Google Sheets and create Trello cards</li>
                            <li><strong>Workflow Management:</strong> To store and manage your workflow configurations</li>
                            <li><strong>User Experience:</strong> To display personalized dashboard information</li>
                            <li><strong>Support:</strong> To provide customer support and troubleshoot issues</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

                    <section class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-blue-600 mr-3"></i>
                            Data Storage and Security
                        </h2>
                        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-4 mb-4">
                            <p class="text-sm text-blue-900 font-semibold mb-2">🔒 Security Measures</p>
                            <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-blue-800 space-y-1">
                                <li>All data is stored in a secure PostgreSQL database</li>
                                <li>Trello API credentials are encrypted using AES-256 encryption before storage</li>
                                <li>Access tokens are stored securely and refreshed automatically</li>
                                <li>All data transmission uses HTTPS encryption</li>
                                <li>We follow industry-standard security practices</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                            We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fas fa-share-alt text-blue-600 mr-3"></i>
                            Data Sharing and Third Parties
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            We do <strong>not</strong> sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We only share data as necessary to provide our services:
                        </p>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
                            <li><strong>Google APIs:</strong> We use Google Sheets API and Google Drive API (read-only) to access your sheets as authorized by you</li>
                            <li><strong>Trello API:</strong> We use Trello REST API to create cards on your Trello boards using your provided credentials</li>
                            <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> We may use third-party service providers (hosting, database) that are bound by confidentiality agreements</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mt-4">
                            We do not share your data with advertisers, marketers, or any other third parties for their own purposes.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fas fa-user-shield text-blue-600 mr-3"></i>
                            Your Rights and Choices
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">You have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
                            <li><strong>Access:</strong> You can request access to your personal data stored in our system</li>
                            <li><strong>Correction:</strong> You can update your account information through the settings page</li>
                            <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> You can delete your account and all associated data at any time</li>
                            <li><strong>Revoke Access:</strong> You can revoke Google OAuth access at any time through your Google account settings</li>
                            <li><strong>Data Export:</strong> You can request an export of your data</li>
                            <li><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> You can stop using our service and delete your account at any time</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mt-4">
                            To exercise these rights, please contact us using the information provided in the "Contact Us" section below.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fas fa-clock text-blue-600 mr-3"></i>
                            Data Retention
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            We retain your personal information for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide you services. Specifically:
                        </p>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
                            <li>Account information is retained while your account is active</li>
                            <li>Workflow configurations are retained until you delete them or your account</li>
                            <li>Google Sheets content is <strong>not</strong> permanently stored - only accessed temporarily during workflow execution</li>
                            <li>Upon account deletion, all associated data is permanently removed from our systems</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

                    <section class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fas fa-cookie text-blue-600 mr-3"></i>
                            Cookies and Tracking
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            We use session cookies to maintain your login state and provide a secure authentication experience. These cookies are:
                        </p>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
                            <li>Essential for the functionality of our service</li>
                            <li>Not used for tracking or advertising purposes</li>
                            <li>Automatically deleted when you log out or close your browser</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mt-4">
                            We do not use third-party tracking cookies or analytics services that collect personal information.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fas fa-globe text-blue-600 mr-3"></i>
                            International Data Transfers
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                            Your information may be transferred to and processed in countries other than your country of residence. We ensure that appropriate safeguards are in place to protect your data in accordance with this Privacy Policy.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fas fa-child text-blue-600 mr-3"></i>
                            Children's Privacy
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                            Our service is not intended for children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe we have collected information from a child under 13, please contact us immediately.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fas fa-edit text-blue-600 mr-3"></i>
                            Changes to This Privacy Policy
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last updated" date. You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fas fa-envelope text-blue-600 mr-3"></i>
                            Contact Us
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us:
                        </p>
                        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4">
                            <p class="text-gray-700">
                                <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hdumradiya.weapplinse@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline">hdumradiya.weapplinse@gmail.com</a><br>
                                <strong>Support:</strong> Available through the application dashboard
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
                    <% if (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user) { %>
                        <a href="/dashboard" class="inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 font-medium">
                            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left mr-2"></i>Back to Dashboard
                        </a>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <a href="/login" class="inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 font-medium">
                            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left mr-2"></i>Back to Login
                        </a>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
        <%- include('partials/footer', { currentYear: new Date().getFullYear() }) %>
        <%- include('partials/modal') %>
    </div>
    <script>
        // Logout handler
        async function handleLogout(event) {
            event.preventDefault();
            const confirmed = await customModal.show({
                title: 'Logout',
                message: 'Are you sure you want to logout?',
                confirmText: 'Logout',
                cancelText: 'Cancel',
                type: 'warning'
            });
            if (confirmed) {
                window.location.href = '/auth/logout';
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>

